## 540. 大素数构型尾展开

```lean
theorem constellation_localFactor_expansion
    (H : PrimeConstellation)
    (p : Nat.Primes)
    (hp : H.diameter < p) :
    localFactor p H =
      1 -
        H.card * (H.card - 1) /
          (2 * p ^ 2) +
        localRemainder p H
```

并证明：

$$
|\operatorname{localRemainder}|
\le
C_Hp^{-3}.
$$

